    {
      "title": "Магазин: id вычисляется из ключа",
      "text": "У магазина ключ — `name`. Поэтому id не случайный: он вычисляется из арендатора, класса и названия. `db.idOf` даёт тот же id заранее, без записи.",
      "code": "[shop] = await db.Shop().create({ name: 'Ромашка', city: 'Казань' }).rows();\nreturn { sameId: (await db.idOf('Shop', { name: 'Ромашка' })) === shop.id };",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[shop] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Shop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ромашка'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, city: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Казань'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { sameId: (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">idOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Shop'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ромашка'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shop.id };</span></span></code></pre>",
