    {
      "title": "Товар: магазин — из пути, категории — слотом",
      "text": "`db.Shop(shop).Product().create(…)` сам ставит ссылку на магазин: он берётся из пути цепочки. Категорий у товара может быть несколько (`many`, не больше 5) — `.Category.add(green)` добавляет одну.",
      "code": "[sencha] = await db.Shop(shop).Product().create({ sku: 'T-7', title: 'Сенча', price: 900 }).Category.add(green).rows();\nreturn sencha;",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[sencha] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Shop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(shop).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ sku: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'T-7'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Сенча'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, price: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">900</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).Category.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(green).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sencha;</span></span></code></pre>",
